4. In the "Text" column, enter the texts you want to analyze.
5. Save the workbook as a CSV file.
6. Open Visual Studio and create a new Console Application project.
7. Install the NuGet package "Microsoft.Azure.CognitiveServices.Language.TextAnalytics" by running the following command in the Package Manager Console: `Install-Package Microsoft.Azure.CognitiveServices.Language.TextAnalytics`
8. In the project, add a reference to the following assemblies: `System.IO`, `System.Linq`, `Microsoft.Azure.CognitiveServices.Language.TextAnalytics`, and `Microsoft.Azure.CognitiveServices.Language.TextAnalytics.Models`.
